    "brief": {
      "text": "The Home page of It's a Date per spec 8.4: sticky header, hero 'Plans worth saying yes to.', sticky What / Vibe / Budget search bar with a Filters pill (duration), category row, New / Top rated sort, 12 idea cards, Show more, and a States board.",
      "answers": {
        "purpose": "Explaining a product or service",
        "theme": "Light",
        "density": "A multi-section site page"
      },
      "assumptions": [
        "Light theme only (spec section 4)",
        "Logged in as Maya Chen on the main view; logged-out header shown on the States board",
        "Search segments are What / Vibe / Budget plus a Filters pill for duration, never Where / When",
        "12 sample ideas from the content sheet, more available via Show more",
        "Photos are checked Unsplash URLs; one idea has no photo and shows the sunk placeholder"
      ]
    },
